scenario: reset-undone
Z         commit(), then close()                                                                       returned normally
observer  pool backend before A                                                                        state=idle xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
observer  where A's committed unqualified insert landed                                                tenant_a/ssc_app
A         setSchema("tenant_a"), insert, commit(), then close()                                        returned normally
observer  pool backend after A's close()                                                               state=idle in transaction xact_open=true xid=false xmin=false
B         same physical session as A                                                                   true
B         current_schema() at checkout                                                                 public
B         current_schema() after B's rollback()                                                        tenant_a
B         close()                                                                                      returned normally
observer  pool backend after B's close()                                                               state=idle xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
C         same physical session as A                                                                   true
observer  where C's committed unqualified insert landed                                                tenant_a/ssc_app
